@* Shared reservation policy, displayed at the beginning and before the deposit step. *@
<p class="eyebrow">PLEASE READ BEFORE BOOKING</p>
<h3 id="reservation-policy-title">Reservation Policy</h3>
<p>Please review the following rules before booking and continuing to your deposit.</p>

                <div class="reservation-policy-grid">
                    <div>
                        <h4>Deposit &amp; minimum spend</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>A <strong>RM50 deposit per guest</strong> is required. The reservation is confirmed only after successful payment.</li>
                            <li>The deposit is deducted from your final dining bill. Indoor/outdoor minimum spending is RM50 per guest.</li>
                            <li>VIP minimum spending is <strong>RM2,400 for 6–8 guests</strong> or <strong>RM3,600 for 9–12 guests</strong>. This is the total dining minimum, separate from the deposit.</li>
                            <li>Complete payment within the displayed hold period of up to 10 minutes, or the unpaid booking expires.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Cancellation</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>You may cancel a pending or confirmed booking. Seated and completed bookings cannot be cancelled.</li>
                            <li><strong>The entire paid deposit is forfeited, regardless of how early you cancel. No refunds are provided.</strong> An unpaid pending booking has no paid deposit to forfeit.</li>
                            <li>Cancellation releases your assigned seating. A new booking requires a new deposit.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Modification</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>A confirmed booking may be rescheduled <strong>once, more than 168 hours (7 full days) before its original date and time</strong>, subject to availability.</li>
                            <li>Only the date and/or arrival time may change. Party size and dining area stay unchanged.</li>
                            <li>Your deposit stays attached; no additional deposit is required. Staff follow the same restrictions.</li>
                            <li>If modification is unavailable, you must cancel, forfeit the paid deposit and make a new booking with a new deposit.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Dining duration</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Indoor/outdoor: 2 hours</strong> from your reserved arrival time.</li>
                            <li><strong>VIP room: from your reserved arrival time until closing.</strong></li>
                            <li>Arriving late does not extend your dining end time.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="policy-arrival">
                        <h4>Arrival &amp; late arrival</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Check in with restaurant staff on arrival. Dine-in ordering is activated after staff check-in.</li>
                            <li>Your seating is normally held for <strong>10 minutes</strong>. Report a delay through your reservation page before that deadline to extend the hold to <strong>30 minutes from your reserved arrival time</strong>.</li>
                            <li>If you do not check in before the applicable deadline, the booking is marked <strong>No-show</strong>, the paid deposit is forfeited and your seating is released.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
